  "instructions": [
    "heat the oil in a large pot over medium-high heat.",
    "add the beef and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the miso paste and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "add the stock and bring to a boil.",
    "reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "season with salt, black pepper, and cinnamon.",
    "serve the beef and sauce over couscous.",
    "fluff the couscous with a fork and add a sprinkle of cinnamon, if desired."
